# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. Never commit the real file.
# See README.md → Publishing → Setting it up.

# Fine-grained PAT, scoped to this repository, Contents: Read and write.
GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_...

# The edit-mode passcode, in plain text. Must match the one the page asks for.
EDIT_PASSCODE=...

# Optional.
# GITHUB_REPO=kitavkdl/jiyul-showcase-magic
# GITHUB_BRANCH=main
